"\".. so from the wells of night to the gulfs of space, and from the gulfs of space to the wells of night... Ever Their praises, and abundance to the Black Goat of the Woods. Iä! Shub-Niggurath! The Goat with a Thousand Young\"\n"
"- H.P. Lovecraft, \"The Whisperer in Darkness\""
