msgid ""
"<i>Circus Ex Mortis</i> is an eight-part campaign for <i>Arkham Horror: The Card Game</i> for 1-4 players. This campaign is based on various works by H. P. Lovecraft and draws from real-life events, historical and mythological figures, secret societies, and of course the circus.\n"
"As a general notice to people who have a fear or aversion to clowns, clowns do appear in this campaign, but the art chosen for these cards avoids the typical killer clown image."
msgstr ""

